& [Purpose]
  + transform one exact NativeArtifactCandidate into attributable build evidence through a separately authorized conventional toolchain seam
  + distinguish build authorization process observation artifact receipt independent verification signing admission installation deployment and execution
  + produce the smallest deterministic machine surface that can later be connected to a physical sandbox runner

& [BuildAuthorization]
  + binds exact seed candidate projection native build plan capability receipt runner executable and sandbox admission identities and digests
  + requires exact requested capabilities SourceRead Build FileWrite and ProcessExecute under the seed ceiling
  + forbids Network Install ExternalEffect and every undeclared capability
  + binds one create-new disposable build root one create-new output path exact command environment and finite time process memory output byte and artifact bounds
  + expires under supplied logical time and is single-use by exact authorization identity

& [SandboxAdmission]
  + is externally supplied evidence rather than a claim inferred by Cantor
  + binds provider platform profile root identity root path policy network denial repository-write denial seal-root denial credential denial allowed executable and environment digests and evidence references
  + must explicitly distinguish logical path validation from physical containment
  + physical containment remains unresolved unless the supplied provider evidence proves it for the target host

& [BuildObservation]
  + is the exact result supplied by the effectful runner after one authorized attempt
  + binds authorization candidate command environment runner sandbox start end exit stdout stderr resource account and observed artifact identities paths sizes and digests
  + records success failure timeout cancellation or infrastructure fault without reclassifying observations as verification
  + an incomplete or faulted attempt cannot produce an ArtifactReceipt

& [ArtifactReceipt]
  + is derived only from an exact successful BuildObservation and whole replay of candidate authorization capability and sandbox forms
  + binds produced artifact identity relative path digest byte size media kind target triple build input root and complete upstream lineage
  + disposition is produced_unverified
  + never claims reproducibility interface behavior semantic correctness signature admission installation execution or successor recognition

& [IndependentVerification]
  + is a separate plan and receipt over immutable ArtifactReceipt identity
  + requires an independently identified verifier and independently supplied artifact digest observation
  + checks exact digest size target interface schema and declared verifier set correspondence
  + may return passed failed or unresolved but cannot sign admit install deploy execute or recognize a successor
  + reproducibility requires a separately identified second build observation and exact artifact equality rather than an assertion

& [ImplementationSelection]
  + add strict pure forms validators domain-separated digests projection and replay in cantor_core
  + expose a runner trait or observation boundary without placing ambient filesystem process network clock or environment access in the core projector
  + use deterministic fake-runner fixtures for positive and adversarial lifecycle coverage
  + optionally record one controlled local Cargo proof as implementation evidence but do not call it a physical sandbox proof
  + do not add a production process runner until an exact host sandbox profile and denial matrix are independently admitted

& [Acceptance]
  + equal complete inputs yield byte-identical authorization receipt and verification forms
  + stale candidate capability sandbox command environment runner time path artifact digest size target verifier and second-build substitutions fail closed
  + failed timeout cancelled and infrastructure-fault observations never yield an artifact receipt
  + unknown fields and cross-backend identities refuse
  + focused debug optimized release unchanged compiler workspace warnings-denied lint format evidence and diff gates pass

& [Locked]
